<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#101827">
<title>LUMBUNG KLIPS — Video Studio</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#0c1422;--panel:#152238;--panel2:#1c2d46;--line:#2b405e;--mint:#63e6b4;--text:#f3f7fc;--muted:#a9b8cc;--gold:#f4c76b}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#101d31,#0c1422 38%);color:var(--text);font-family:Arial,sans-serif}
header{padding:23px 17px 18px;background:#14243a;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
.logo{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:13px;background:#0b1422;border:1px solid #3b5876;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:23px}
h1{font-size:22px;letter-spacing:.5px;margin:0;color:var(--mint)}
header p{margin:5px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}
main{max-width:760px;margin:auto;padding:13px 14px 30px}
.notice{border:1px solid #66552d;background:#302a1c;color:#f6e5b6;border-radius:13px;padding:12px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55}
nav{display:flex;gap:7px;overflow:auto;padding:13px 0;position:sticky;top:0;background:#0e1929;z-index:5}
nav button{white-space:nowrap;padding:10px 12px}
button{border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;background:var(--mint);color:#09251c;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer}
button.secondary{background:#2b405e;color:#f3f7fc}
button:disabled{opacity:.55}
section{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:15px;margin:12px 0;scroll-margin-top:72px}
h2{font-size:17px;color:var(--mint);margin:0 0 12px}
h3{font-size:14px;margin:13px 0 7px;color:#dce8f6}
p{line-height:1.5}
.muted,small{color:var(--muted)}
.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px}
.stat{background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid #2b405e;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
.stat strong{display:block;color:var(--text);font-size:19px;margin-top:7px}
.status{display:inline-block;border-radius:30px;padding:4px 9px;font-size:11px;background:#493d22;color:#f6d88f}
.status.ok{background:#163d34;color:#8ff0c9}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:9px}
.tile{background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid #2b405e;border-radius:12px;padding:12px}
.tile b{display:block;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:13px}
.tile span{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.4}
label{display:block;font-size:12px;color:#c8d5e6;margin:12px 0 6px}
input,textarea,select{width:100%;padding:12px;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid #526780;background:#0d192a;color:white;font-size:14px}
textarea{min-height:78px;resize:vertical}
.actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px}
.output{white-space:pre-wrap;background:#0d192a;border:1px solid #2b405e;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;margin-top:12px;line-height:1.55;font-size:12px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.file{padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #2b405e;font-size:13px}
.file:last-child{border:0}
footer{text-align:center;padding:20px;color:#8193aa;font-size:11px}
@media(max-width:420px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
 <div class="brand">
  <div class="logo">LK</div>
  <div><h1>LUMBUNG KLIPS</h1><p>AI VIDEO CLIPPING STUDIO · MODE PERINTAH</p></div>
 </div>
</header>
<main>
 <div class="notice"><b>STATUS STUDIO</b><br>Dashboard video clipping sedang disiapkan. Hubungkan Google Drive untuk membaca materi. Pemotongan video, subtitle otomatis, dan pemantauan TikTok belum aktif sampai mesin pemrosesnya dipasang.</div>
 <nav>
  <button onclick="go('dashboard')">Dashboard</button>
  <button class="secondary" onclick="go('drive')">Google Drive</button>
  <button class="secondary" onclick="go('clip')">Video Clipper</button>
  <button class="secondary" onclick="go('caption')">Caption</button>
  <button class="secondary" onclick="go('monitor')">TikTok</button>
 </nav>

 <section id="dashboard">
  <h2>🎬 Pusat Kendali Video</h2>
  <p>Selamat datang di ruang kerja LUMBUNG KLIPS. Masukkan materi video ke Google Drive, lalu siapkan klip pendek untuk TikTok.</p>
  <div class="stats">
   <div class="stat">Materi di Drive<strong id="fileCount">Belum dicek</strong></div>
   <div class="stat">Klip selesai<strong>0</strong></div>
   <div class="stat">Durasi target<strong>15–20 detik</strong></div>
   <div class="stat">Status Google Drive<strong id="driveStatus">Belum diuji</strong></div>
  </div>
  <h3>Alur kerja studio</h3>
  <div class="grid">
   <div class="tile"><b>1. Materi video</b><span>Ambil video sumber dari folder Google Drive khusus.</span></div>
   <div class="tile"><b>2. Pilih momen</b><span>Tentukan bagian terbaik untuk klip singkat.</span></div>
   <div class="tile"><b>3. Edit & subtitle</b><span>Tambahkan hook, isi utama, dan teks layar.</span></div>
   <div class="tile"><b>4. Siap TikTok</b><span>Buat caption dan unggah manual ke akun TikTok.</span></div>
  </div>
 </section>

 <section id="drive">
  <h2>☁️ Google Drive — Materi Video</h2>
  <p class="muted">Folder kerja: <b>LUMBUNG KLIPS - MATERI VIDEO</b></p>
  <span class="status" id="driveBadge">Belum terhubung</span>
  <div class="actions">
   <button id="connectDrive">Hubungkan Google Drive</button>
   <button class="secondary" id="loadFiles">Periksa Materi Video</button>
  </div>
  <div class="output" id="driveOutput">Belum ada pemeriksaan. Tekan “Hubungkan Google Drive” untuk memulai izin Google, atau “Periksa Materi Video” setelah konfigurasi Drive selesai.</div>
 </section>

 <section id="clip">
  <h2>✂️ Video Clipper</h2>
  <p class="muted">Ruang persiapan klip. Mesin pemotong video belum dipasang.</p>
  <label for="sourceName">Nama file video sumber</label>
  <input id="sourceName" placeholder="Pilih nama video dari daftar Drive">
  <label for="duration">Durasi klip yang diinginkan</label>
  <select id="duration"><option>15 detik</option><option selected>20 detik</option></select>
  <label for="hook">Hook pembuka</label>
  <textarea id="hook" placeholder="Contoh: Bagian ini jangan sampai terlewat..."></textarea>
  <label for="mainPoint">Isi utama</label>
  <textarea id="mainPoint" placeholder="Tuliskan inti yang ingin disampaikan"></textarea>
  <div class="output">Status: belum dapat merender atau mengunduh video. Tahap berikutnya adalah memasang mesin pemrosesan klip.</div>
 </section>

 <section id="caption">
  <h2>✍️ Caption & Naskah</h2>
  <label for="topic">Topik klip</label>
  <input id="topic" placeholder="Apa isi video ini?">
  <label for="desc">Poin penting</label>
  <textarea id="desc" placeholder="Tuliskan poin utama video"></textarea>
  <div class="actions"><button id="makeCaption">Susun Caption</button></div>
  <div class="output" id="captionOutput">Caption akan tampil di sini. Ini alat penyusunan teks sederhana, belum menggunakan AI eksternal.</div>
 </section>

 <section id="monitor">
  <h2>📊 TikTok Monitor</h2>
  <p class="muted">Catat metrik secara manual setelah video diposting. Koneksi otomatis ke TikTok belum tersedia.</p>
  <label for="videoTitle">Judul / nama video</label><input id="videoTitle" placeholder="Nama klip">
  <div class="grid">
   <div><label for="views">Views</label><input id="views" type="number" min="0" placeholder="0"></div>
   <div><label for="likes">Likes</label><input id="likes" type="number" min="0" placeholder="0"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="actions"><button id="saveMetrics">Simpan Catatan</button></div>
  <div class="output" id="metricsOutput">Belum ada catatan metrik.</div>
 </section>
 <footer>LUMBUNG KLIPS · VIDEO CLIPPING STUDIO · Unggah TikTok dilakukan manual oleh pemilik akun.</footer>
</main>
<script>
(function(){
 const $=id=>document.getElementById(id);
 const endpoint='/.netlify/functions/drive';
 window.go=id=>{const e=$(id);if(e)e.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'start'});};
 $('connectDrive').addEventListener('click',()=>{location.href=endpoint+'?action=auth';});
 $('loadFiles').addEventListener('click',async()=>{
  const out=$('driveOutput');out.textContent='Memeriksa koneksi dan folder Google Drive...';
  try{
   const r=await fetch(endpoint+'?action=list',{headers:{'Accept':'application/json'}});
   const data=await r.json();
   if(!r.ok||data.error)throw new Error(data.error||'Permintaan gagal ('+r.status+').');
   const files=data.files||[];
   $('fileCount').textContent=String(files.length);
   $('driveStatus').textContent='Terhubung';
   $('driveBadge').textContent='Terhubung';
   $('driveBadge').className='status ok';
   out.textContent=files.length?'Daftar materi video:\n\n'+files.map((f,i)=>(i+1)+'. '+f.name+' ('+f.mimeType+')').join('\n'):'Folder berhasil dibaca, tetapi belum ada file di dalamnya.';
  }catch(e){
   $('driveStatus').textContent='Perlu konfigurasi';
   out.textContent='Belum bisa membaca folder: '+e.message+'\n\nPeriksa bahwa GOOGLE_REFRESH_TOKEN dan DRIVE_FOLDER_ID sudah diatur di Netlify. Jangan masukkan token ke kolom dashboard atau bagikan lewat chat.';
  }
 });
 $('makeCaption').addEventListener('click',()=>{
  const topic=$('topic').value.trim()||'video ini';
  const desc=$('desc').value.trim();
  $('captionOutput').textContent='HOOK: '+topic+' — simak sampai selesai!\n\nISI: '+(desc||'Tambahkan poin utama video di bagian ini.')+'\n\nCAPTION: '+topic+'. '+(desc||'Temukan hal menarik dari video ini.')+'\n\n#LumbungKlips #TikTokIndonesia #VideoPendek';
 });
 $('saveMetrics').addEventListener('click',()=>{
  const item={title:$('videoTitle').value.trim()||'Video tanpa judul',views:+$('views').value||0,likes:+$('likes').value||0,date:new Date().toLocaleDateString('id-ID')};
  let list=[];try{list=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('lk_video_metrics')||'[]');}catch(e){}
  list.unshift(item);try{localStorage.setItem('lk_video_metrics',JSON.stringify(list));}catch(e){}
  $('metricsOutput').textContent=list.map(x=>x.date+' · '+x.title+'\nViews: '+x.views+' | Likes: '+x.likes).join('\n\n');
 });
 try{
  const list=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('lk_video_metrics')||'[]');
  if(list.length)$('metricsOutput').textContent=list.map(x=>x.date+' · '+x.title+'\nViews: '+x.views+' | Likes: '+x.likes).join('\n\n');
 }catch(e){}
 // If Google redirects back with an OAuth code, explain that the current backend returns the token securely as a one-time response.
 if(new URLSearchParams(location.search).has('code')){
  $('driveOutput').textContent='Google mengembalikan proses izin. Periksa respons pada halaman ini. Jika terlihat refresh_token, simpan hanya ke variabel GOOGLE_REFRESH_TOKEN di Netlify; jangan bagikan token tersebut.';
  go('drive');
 }
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>